13)\n*Belinda Bauer \u2013 Snap (May 15)\n*John Boyne \u2013 A Ladder to the Sky\n*Anna Burns \u2013 Milkman (May, UK)\n*Jonathan Coe \u2013 Middle England (November 8, UK)\n*S. A. Cosby \u2013 My Darkest Prayer\n*"
